(target: both agents)
This diff targets OpenShift (not vanilla Kubernetes). Check for
OpenShift-specific resources: Routes (not Ingress), SCCs
(SecurityContextConstraints) instead of PSPs, OAuthClient for
authentication. Verify SCC bindings use least-privilege — avoid
`system:openshift:scc:privileged` unless justified. Check OLMv1
operator packaging: ClusterServiceVersion must declare all RBAC
permissions the operator needs. Verify Route TLS termination
mode is correct (edge, passthrough, reencrypt). Check that
`DeploymentConfig` is not used — use `Deployment` instead (DC
is deprecated). Verify `oc` CLI usage vs `kubectl` — prefer
`kubectl` for portability unless OpenShift-specific features
are needed. Check ImageStreams and BuildConfigs for proper
source-to-image patterns.
